+```
+
+### 验证 checkpoint 正确性
+
+```bash
+# 1. 检查 magic number
+hexdump -C checkpoint.bin | head -1
+# 应该看到: ef be ad de (0xdeadbeef little-endian)
+
+# 2. 解析完整内容
